From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:13:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(richtext): support custom underline color, thickness and
 offset

Add textDecorationColor/Thickness/Offset to Compose SpanStyle and the core
TextAttr/TextSpan API, and render them natively. Android marks the range with
a breakable CharacterStyle and the drawer paints the underline after the
glyphs with skip-ink gaps, so long decorated runs still wrap. iOS maps color
and thickness onto NSUnderline attributes; OHOS sets decoration color and a
thickness scale corrected for the engine's 1/18 base.

Fork-Patch: richtext-custom-underline-style
Origin: 3bd6a618 e58c787b 969ac425 f7eb31c8
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
